Feature: Chief Procurement Officer Strategic Risk Management
  As Sarah Chen, Chief Procurement Officer
  I want to transform procurement from reactive to predictive risk management
  So that I can ensure supply chain resilience and achieve cost savings targets across $45B annual spend

  Background:
    Given I am logged in as Sarah Chen, Chief Procurement Officer
    And I have access to the executive supplier risk management system
    And I oversee 15,000+ suppliers across global procurement operations

  @executive-dashboard @real-time-monitoring
  Scenario: Monitor portfolio-wide supplier risk in real-time
    Given I need to review overnight supplier risk changes
    When I access the executive risk dashboard in the morning
    Then I should see a high-level risk score for the entire supplier portfolio
    And I should see alerts for any suppliers with significant risk changes
    And I should see geographic risk distribution across my supplier base
    And I should see category-wise risk exposure analysis
    And I should be able to drill down into specific risk categories or regions

  @crisis-management @alternative-suppliers
  Scenario: Rapidly identify alternatives during supply chain disruption
    Given a major supplier in my portfolio faces unexpected disruption
    And this supplier represents $200M in annual spend
    When a supply disruption is detected and flagged as critical
    Then the system should identify alternative suppliers within 24 hours
    And alternatives should be ranked by capability and risk score
    And I should see estimated transition timelines and costs
    And I should receive automated stakeholder notifications
    And I should be able to initiate emergency procurement procedures

  @board-reporting @executive-communication
  Scenario: Generate executive briefings for board and C-suite reporting
    Given I have a quarterly board meeting to report on supply chain resilience
    When I request an executive summary report
    Then I should receive a presentation-ready risk assessment report
    And the report should include key risk metrics and trends
    And the report should highlight top risk exposures and mitigation actions
    And the report should show progress toward diversification goals
    And I should be able to customize the report for different audiences

  @tariff-impact-analysis @trade-policy
  Scenario: Assess portfolio impact of new tariff announcements
    Given new tariffs are announced on electronics imports from China
    When I request a tariff impact analysis
    Then I should see total spend exposure to the new tariffs
    And I should see affected suppliers ranked by impact severity
    And I should see recommended mitigation strategies for each affected category
    And I should get timeline estimates for supplier diversification
    And I should be able to model different tariff scenarios

  @supplier-concentration @portfolio-optimization
  Scenario: Optimize supplier portfolio to reduce concentration risk
    Given I want to ensure no single supplier exceeds 5% of total spend
    When I analyze supplier concentration across my portfolio
    Then I should see current concentration levels by supplier and category
    And I should see concentration risk scores and trending
    And I should receive recommendations for rebalancing supplier allocations
    And I should see projected timelines and costs for portfolio optimization
    And I should be able to set concentration targets by category

  @cost-savings @performance-tracking
  Scenario: Track cost savings achievement against annual targets
    Given my annual cost savings target is $2B across all categories
    When I review cost savings performance
    Then I should see current savings achievement by category and quarter
    And I should see projected year-end performance against targets
    And I should see impact of supplier diversification on savings goals
    And I should receive early warning alerts for categories at risk of missing targets
    And I should be able to adjust strategies to meet overall targets

  @integration @enterprise-systems
  Scenario: Integrate risk data with SAP Ariba for seamless workflow
    Given I use SAP Ariba for procurement processes
    When supplier risk scores are updated in the risk management system
    Then risk scores should automatically update in SAP Ariba
    And procurement teams should see risk warnings during supplier selection
    And contract approvals should include risk assessment data
    And I should have confidence that all procurement decisions include risk factors

  @mobile-executive @critical-alerts
  Scenario: Receive critical alerts on mobile device during travel
    Given I am traveling internationally for supplier meetings
    And I have configured mobile alerts for critical supply chain events
    When a supplier risk score changes to critical level
    Then I should receive a mobile alert within 30 minutes
    And the alert should include business impact assessment
    And I should be able to escalate to appropriate team members
    And I should be able to approve emergency supplier changes remotely

  @supplier-diversity @sustainability
  Scenario: Monitor supplier diversity and sustainability metrics
    Given my target is 15% spend with diverse suppliers
    And I am committed to responsible sourcing practices
    When I review supplier diversity and sustainability performance
    Then I should see current diverse supplier spend percentage
    And I should see sustainability scores for major suppliers
    And I should see progress toward diversity and sustainability goals
    And I should receive recommendations for improving diversity metrics

  @predictive-analytics @proactive-management
  Scenario: Use predictive analytics to prevent supplier disruptions
    Given the system has historical supplier performance data
    When I want to identify suppliers at risk of future disruption
    Then the system should use predictive models to forecast supplier risks
    And I should see early warning indicators for potential issues
    And I should receive proactive recommendations for risk mitigation
    And I should be able to take preventive actions before disruptions occur

  @team-productivity @delegation
  Scenario: Enable team decision-making with appropriate authority levels
    Given I need to delegate certain risk management decisions to my team
    When I configure approval workflows and authority levels
    Then team members should be able to make decisions within their authority
    And I should receive notifications for decisions requiring my approval
    And I should have audit trails for all risk management decisions
    And I should be able to monitor team performance and decision quality
